              "value": "The residential building of the Deaconess Institute's block, located at the corner of Alppikatu and Kolmas linja. In the City of Helsinki's Participation and Assessment Plan (OAS), published on March 3, 2025, the city is planning redevelopment of the residential building's site. According to the OAS, the building was completed in 1955 and was designed by architect Eino Tuompo. In the OAS, the building is also listed under the name Alppikulma. The building has nine floors.\nViewing direction west. In the foreground of the image is the intersection of Alppikatu and Kolmas linja.",
